        <Param val="Thank You for participating in the experiment.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this experiment, if the stimuli displayed is tilted towards the left, press the key &quot;Left Arrow Key&quot;, and if it is tilted towards the right, press the key &quot;Right Arrow Key&quot; on your keyboard.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In case you wish to exit the experiment in the middle, you can press the &quot;esc&quot; key.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Once you have read and understood the instructions, press &quot;space&quot; to start the experiment." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
